<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
  <title>Reset your password · FormNest</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F1F5F9 0%, #E6EDF4 100%);
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.5;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .reset-card {
      max-width: 620px;
      width: 100%;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 45px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      overflow: hidden;
      animation: slideUp 0.4s ease;
    }
    .inner { padding: 2.5rem 2rem; }
    .brand-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #EDF2F7;
      padding-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .logo-icon {
      background: #4F46E5;
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .logo-icon svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; color: white; }
    .brand-name h2 { font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; background: linear-gradient(145deg,#0F172A,#1E2A44); background-clip: text; -webkit-background-clip: text; color: transparent; }
    .greeting { font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0A0F1C; margin: 0.25rem 0 0.5rem; }
    .reset-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      background: #EEF2FF;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 40px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #4F46E5;
      margin: 0.5rem 0;
    }
    .info-text {
      background: #F9FCFF;
      border-left: 4px solid #4F46E5;
      padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 1rem;
      margin: 1rem 0;
      color: #1E293B;
    }
    .btn-wrapper { margin: 1.75rem 0 1.5rem; }
    .reset-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      background: linear-gradient(105deg, #4F46E5, #6366F1);
      color: white;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 60px;
      text-decoration: none;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 18px -8px rgba(79,70,229,0.4);
      transition: 0.2s;
    }
    .reset-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: #3C37B0; box-shadow: 0 16px 24px -10px rgba(79,70,229,0.5); }
    .link-fallback {
      background: #F8FAFE;
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      padding: 1rem;
      margin: 1.25rem 0;
      border: 1px solid #E9EDF2;
    }
    .link-label { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; color: #5B6E8C; margin-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
    .link-url { background: white; padding: 12px; border-radius: 1rem; font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; word-break: break-all; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; }
    .expiry-card {
      background: #FFF7ED;
      border-radius: 1rem;
      padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #FFE4C4;
      margin: 1rem 0;
    }
    .footer-note { text-align: center; font-size: 0.73rem; color: #6C7A92; margin-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid #EDF2F7; padding-top: 1.2rem; }
    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .inner { padding: 1.75rem 1.25rem; }
      .greeting { font-size: 1.5rem; }
      .reset-btn { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
    }
    @keyframes slideUp { 0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); } 100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="reset-card">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="brand-header">
      <div class="logo-icon">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="brand-name"><h2>FormNest</h2></div>
    </div>
    <div class="greeting">Hi {{name}},</div>
    <div class="reset-badge">🔐 PASSWORD RESET REQUEST</div>
    <div class="info-text">
      We received a request to reset your FormNest account password. Click the button below to create a new password.
    </div>
    <div class="btn-wrapper">
      <a href="{{resetUrl}}" class="reset-btn">
        <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 7l5 5-5 5M4 12h16"/></svg>
        Reset Password
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="link-fallback">
      <div class="link-label"><span>🔗</span> MANUAL LINK</div>
      <div class="link-url">{{resetUrl}}</div>
      <div style="font-size: 0.7rem; margin-top: 8px; color: #5F7F9E;">If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="expiry-card">
      <span>⏳</span>
      <div><strong>Expires in 1 hour</strong> — for your security, this link is time-sensitive.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-note">
      ✉️ Didn’t request a password reset? Ignore this email — your password will remain unchanged.<br>
      © 2025 FormNest · account security
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>